    "description": "Download The Short Years app and create your first baby book chapter in just five minutes!\r\n\r\nOnce a week, The Short Years App will remind you to upload a photo and answer a couple of questions about your baby\u2019s milestones and special moments. Many parents tell us they do this while feeding their baby or watching a show on Netflix.\r\n\r\nWe\u2019ll turn your text, photos, and even video into beautiful baby book pages!\r\n\r\nOnce you\u2019ve purchased your book, we will start printing and shipping your pages to you every time you complete three chapters in the app. Just pop them in your book!\r\n\r\nAnd, if you want to capture all of the sweet memories until your baby turns five, simply add on \u201cThe Toddler Years\u201d at checkout. Doing so will allow you to access The Toddler Years chapters in your app and to receive these extra chapters in print to add to your baby book.\r\n\r\nThe Short Years Baby Book has a premium fabric cover, handcrafted to stand up to a lifetime of enjoyment and measuring 11.5\u201d x 9.25\u201d. It is bound with three matte black rings, making adding pages to it a breeze.\r\n\r\nThe book includes:\r\n\r\n*19 chapter covers (+ an additional 5 if you upgrade to The Toddler Years) for easily organizing your book\u2019s pages as they are shipped to you.\r\n*Hands and feet prints pages to take with you to the hospital or birth center.\r\n*Six lined journaling pages for jotting down extra notes\r\n*Personalized name card for cover\r\n*Free printing and shipping of all 119 of your baby book pages documenting baby\u2019s first year.\r\n\r\n\r\nDiscover the easiest way to document and cherish your sweet one\u2019s first year!",
